# .lettaignore — Letta Code file index exclusions
#
# Files and directories matching these patterns are excluded from the @ file
# search index (cache). They won't appear in autocomplete results by default,
# but can still be found if you type their path explicitly.
#
# Syntax: one pattern per line, supports globs (e.g. *.log, src/generated/**)
# Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# The following are always excluded (even from explicit search) and do not need
# to be listed here:
#   node_modules  dist  build  out  coverage  target  bower_components
#   .git  .cache  .next  .nuxt  venv  .venv  __pycache__  .tox

# Lock files
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml
poetry.lock
Cargo.lock

# Logs
*.log

# OS artifacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECURITY EXCLUSIONS (Phase 1 — pa-web-ui direct letta-code migration)
#
# These patterns block Letta-code's file tools (Read / Edit / Write / Glob
# / Grep) from accessing secret-bearing paths. Bash is NOT affected by
# this file — the bind-mount scope in docker-compose.yml is the primary
# defense for Bash. Keep this file in sync with the carve-out inventory
# at docs/security/pa-web-ui-threat-model.md.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------

# Environment / secrets
.env
.env.*
.env.backup
.env.bak
.env.backup.*
.env.local
.env.production
.env.test
**/.env
**/.env.*

# OAuth tokens and API credentials
.granola-tokens.json
.granola-client.json
**/credentials/
**/*credentials*.json
**/credentials.json
pa-web-ui/letta-credentials/

# Private keys and certificates
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.crt
**/.androidtvremote/
**/.androidtvremote2/

# Session / OAuth state
slack_auth_state.json
.letta/settings.local.json
smaug-data/.state/
slackbot/state_store/
letta/.granola_*_state.json

# Database backups and dumps
*.sql
*.sql.gz
*.dump
deployment/backups-tmpsave/
n8n_database_backup_*.sql

# Browser / session persistence
**/browser_states/

# Exports and backups that may embed secrets
letta/exports/
letta/backups/
deployment/logs/

# SSH material (defense in depth)
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/known_hosts
**/authorized_keys
**/.ssh/

# Generic wildcards
**/*secret*
**/*token*
